<h1>Referrals</h1>
<p class="lede">We're referral-based. If you send a friend or neighbor our way and they start Regular Service, your next invoice is probably on us.</p>
<hr>
<h2>How do I refer someone?</h2>
<p>Text us at <a href="sms:{{ site.phone.tel }}">{{ site.phone.display }}</a> with:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Your name</li>
  <li>Your friend's or neighbor's name, plus their address if the name is easy to mix up</li>
  <li>Whether they're expecting to hear from us, or if we should wait for them to reach out</li>
</ul>
<p>No logins or forms... Once they start Regular Service, we'll take care of your next invoice.</p>
<p>No friends? An <a href="/reviews">online review</a> helps us out too.</p>
